OL,3,APensioner with 'largest hoard' of child
OL,4,Aabuse images found in Scotland jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pensioner who amassed what is thought
OL,7,Fto be the largest collection of child
OL,8,Fsexual abuse material ever seized by
OL,9,Fpolice in Scotland has been jailed for
OL,10,Ffour years.
OL,12,FAlan MacPherson, 83, from
OL,13,FStenhousemuir, was found to have more
OL,14,Fthan two million images on various
OL,15,Felectronic devices after his home was
OL,16,Fraided in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
