OL,3,APensioner with 'largest hoard' of child
OL,4,Aabuse images found in Scotland jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 805,000 were identified as
OL,7,Fdepicting child sexual abuse - much of
OL,8,Fit in the most serious category - while
OL,9,Fthe overwhelming scale of his
OL,10,Fcollection meant much of material was
OL,11,Fnot checked and categorised.
OL,13,FMacPherson was told by Sheriff Mayram
OL,14,FLabaki that the scale of his crime was
OL,15,F"exceptional".
